# evidence-for: FR-032, US-004, GI-007
# evidence-timeout: 120

# FR-032's single constant, driven over the three groups that define it.
#
# GROUP 1 -- D-033. VERIFIER_PATH_PATTERNS enumerated five tools/ basenames, so
# every other gate-path module answered False. foundry_report.py carries
# report_status, which IS the DONE precondition; foundry_spawn.py carries
# _manifest_shape_problem, called by foundry_gate. A GRIND diff moving either
# was being judged by a DELTA roster (ST-006). The rule is now the PACKAGE.
#
# GROUP 2 -- D-118, the same staleness one layer over. The prose side went on
# naming its members one directory at a time, so the documents the streams
# LOAD answered False: references/verification-patterns.md is pulled in as a
# binding contract by agents/tracer.md and agents/assayer.md,
# references/lead-discipline.md by commands/start.md, and
# scripts/validate-test-observations.py is what the TEST-01 adjudicator
# EXECUTES as its Layer 1 and halts on. Driven at the transition: a GRIND whose
# only touched file was the tracer's own verification contract recorded mode
# DELTA, rule delta, roster trace/prove/test. The prose rule is now ONE rule
# over the directories that hold loaded contracts, and the anti-staleness pin
# lives in tests/test_vocab.py, which harvests the load instructions out of the
# shipped prose rather than naming files.
#
# GROUP 3 -- the other half of FR-032: the rule still has to be able to say no,
# or DELTA is deleted and every cycle pays for a five-stream INSPECT. The
# boundary is what the document IS, not which directory holds it. A README
# documents the plugin to a human; setup-foundry.sh installs it; measure-run.py
# and migrate-archive.py read a finished archive and print;
# hooks/pre-commit-guard.sh constrains what may be COMMITTED rather than
# judging whether the build is right; the server's own tests are the pins, not
# the judgement, and the TEST stream re-runs them at every width. None of those
# moving can make an earlier cycle's verdict wrong.
#
# The count is still 6 because D-118 collapsed the three flat prose directories
# into one alternation as it added references/ and the validator rule.

